{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService"],"title":"Getting started","generated":true,"anchor":"Getting-started"}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"1. Add the SDK","anchor":"1-Add-the-SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YEOFR"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Swift package","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/yeo-messaging\/YEOFR-SPM"},{"text":") to your project, pinned to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exact version "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.7.6"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", then ","type":"text"},{"code":"import YEOFR","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The binary ships device","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"arm64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and simulator ("},{"code":"arm64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" + "},{"code":"x86_64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") slices, so an app and its tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build either way — but recognition needs a real device and stays inert on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"simulator."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"2. Pilot unlock for non-YEO bundle IDs","anchor":"2-Pilot-unlock-for-non-YEO-bundle-IDs","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YEOFR is gated to YEO-owned apps by default; a non-YEO bundle id aborts on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"construction. Evaluation customers get a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"temporary unlock code","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bypasses the gate during a fixed pilot window — email"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"christo@yeomessaging.com"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" to request one. Pass it to the initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(step 3). YEO-owned apps pass the gate natively."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"3. Drive everything with `FaceTrustService`","anchor":"3-Drive-everything-with-FaceTrustService","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","type":"reference"},{"text":" is the turnkey entry point. It owns the engine, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"camera, the fused-trust pipeline (face recognition + liveness CNN +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TrueDepth), the identity gate, and tracker persistence, and exposes two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"streams: one for live trust verdicts and one for guided enrolment.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import YEOFR","","let service = FaceTrustService(pilotUnlockCode: \"YOUR-PILOT-CODE\")","","\/\/ Attach the preview to an AVCaptureVideoPreviewLayer:","\/\/   previewLayer.session = service.previewSession","","try await service.start()    \/\/ warm-up, restore enrolment, arm gate, start camera"]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"start()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" owns engine warm-up, and there is no public API to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"trigger it yourself. This is deliberate — warm-up must complete before the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first template is extracted, and an engine that is only half-warm answers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enrolment with a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"mismatched embedding","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than an error. Awaiting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"start()"},{"type":"text","text":" before you enrol or match is the whole contract."}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"4. Enrol a face","anchor":"4-Enrol-a-face","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enroll(name:)"},{"text":" runs a short guided capture, persists the gallery, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-arms the identity gate. Iterate the returned stream to coach the user:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["for await step in service.enroll(name: \"Alice\") {","    switch step.phase {","    case .capturing: show(step.prompt, progress: step.poseProgress)","    case .completed: dismiss()","    case .failed:    show(step.prompt)","    @unknown default: break","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A single front pose is enough to separate the enrolled user from other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"people. Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"poses: PoseTarget.lightingAwareGallerySequence"},{"type":"text","text":" to also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"capture off-axis poses + a lighting pass, which improves recall as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user turns their head."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"5. Run live recognition","anchor":"5-Run-live-recognition","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["for await update in service.updates() {","    switch update.status {","    case .trusted:    badge(\"TRUSTED — \\(update.matchedName ?? \"\")\", .green)","    case .notTrusted: badge(\"NOT TRUSTED\", .red)","    case .badFraming: badge(\"ADJUST FRAMING\", .orange)","    case .noFace:     badge(\"NO FACE\", .gray)","    @unknown default: break","    }","    \/\/ update.livenessGenuine \/ update.depthIsThreeD are the contributing signals.","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update.status == .trusted"},{"type":"text","text":" already fuses face recognition, liveness, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TrueDepth, with framing applied — you never pick a similarity threshold,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and you never touch the identity gate (forgetting it would collapse trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to liveness + depth, so any live face would pass). The enrolled gallery is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saved across launches automatically; ","type":"text"},{"code":"service.enrolledName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reflects who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enrolled.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"See-also","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"See also"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A complete, runnable SwiftUI app lives in the package’s "},{"code":"Examples\/FRPilot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService"},{"text":" — full API.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustUpdate"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/EnrollmentProgress"},{"text":" — the stream payloads.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"QuickStart","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}],"role":"article"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/QuickStart"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recognise the enrolled user and reject everyone else, in a few lines."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/updates()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"updates"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"FaceTrustUpdate","preciseIdentifier":"s:5YEOFR15FaceTrustUpdateV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"title":"updates()","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/updates()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Per-frame trust verdicts for the recognition UI. Call once and iterate;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the stream finishes on ","type":"text"},{"code":"stop()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Newest-wins (the underlying camera","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream drops stale frames), so a slow consumer can’t back up memory.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/updates()","type":"topic"},"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/enroll(name:poses:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/enroll(name:poses:)","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/enroll(name:poses:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Enrol "},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from the live camera and return a stream o